data: {"id": "11966fa289964b4e-thinking-layer-319", "run_id": "11966fa289964b4e", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 定位结论\n当前集群中仅发现 1 个异常 Pod：\n\n- **Pod 名称**: `workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r`\n- **命名空间**: `aiops-case-10`\n- **当前状态**: `CrashLoopBackOff` (25次重启)\n- **节点**: `node2`\n\n### 异常分析\n该 Pod 处于反复重启状态。根据状态 `CrashLoopBackOff` 且未明确 OOMKilled 证据，归类为 **CrashLoopBackOffRuntime**。这意味着容器主进程在启动后异常退出或被系统杀死（如探针杀死），导致 Kubernetes 控制器不断重启容器。\n\n### 诊断建议\n需进一步检查以下信息以定位根因：\n1. **崩溃前日志** (`kubectl logs --previous`)：查看进程退出前的最后输出，确认是否有报错（如 `No space left on device`、`Address already in use`、`command not found` 等）。\n2. **Last State 详情** (", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789357241096}

